==English==

===Etymology===
Based on {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|judicieux|lang=fr}}, itself based on {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|iudicium|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/dʒuˈdɪʃ.əs/}}
* {{rhymes|ɪʃəs}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Having, characterized by, or done with good judgment or sound thinking.

